WireTuner: libfreehand for the FreeHand importer (docs/spec/decisions.adoc D-083).
- No Boost, ICU or Little CMS: <cstdint> for boost/cstdint.hpp; the ICU UTF macros come from the
  bridge's shim headers; a process colour's CMYK is converted with the plain formula for
  libfreehand's own output and kept as CMYK for the importer (FHColorProfiles.h is not vendored).
- FHParser and FHCollector befriend FHRecordExporter (bridge/FHRecordExport.cpp), which writes
  the collected records as JSON instead of drawing them through librevenge.
- Kept for the importer: the dictionary's record type names (FHParser::m_dictionaryNames), each
  page's rectangle (FHParser::m_pages, where m_pageInfo is their union), each layer's name record
  (FHLayer::m_nameId), and per colour record its kind, name record, CMYK values and the bytes
  libfreehand skips (FHColorRecord, FHCollector::collectColorRecord).

